WEBVTT

01:36.100 --> 01:41.110
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.410 --> 01:43.880
[Episode 12]

01:45.039 --> 01:46.430
Legend says this Burrow Demon

01:46.430 --> 01:47.759
is in the forest ahead.

01:48.039 --> 01:50.759
We can't go wrong
searching along the riverbank.

01:50.759 --> 01:53.070
They say this person
lives in a burrow like a rat.

01:53.070 --> 01:54.400
Who knows if it's true.

01:56.070 --> 01:56.870
Sirs,

01:57.280 --> 01:59.940
why are you so determined
to join the Power Gang?

02:01.000 --> 02:02.000
It's impressive!

02:02.230 --> 02:04.150
Everyone in the martial world
who hears the name of Power Gang

02:04.150 --> 02:05.280
trembles with fear.

02:06.230 --> 02:07.640
That's somewhat shallow.

02:07.640 --> 02:09.240
I think more into the future.

02:09.240 --> 02:10.030
First of all,

02:10.150 --> 02:11.910
we want to make a name for ourselves,

02:11.910 --> 02:13.520
so we need to join them

02:13.520 --> 02:14.870
and use their reputation.

02:14.870 --> 02:17.030
Secondly, we both have our talents.

02:17.150 --> 02:19.680
The Power Gang
needs talented people like us.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.900
I've even thought of my title.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.360
The poison in my sleeve

02:23.680 --> 02:26.240
works within one step.
No one can guard against it.

02:26.240 --> 02:28.430
So I'll call myself the Poison Demon.

02:28.750 --> 02:30.000
Sounds impressive, right?

02:30.000 --> 02:30.710
Amazing.

02:32.400 --> 02:36.000
People in the martial world
say the Power Gang is notorious.

02:36.800 --> 02:40.400
If they asked you to kill,
commit arson, and harm innocent people,

02:40.400 --> 02:41.430
would you do it?

02:43.240 --> 02:45.590
We haven't thought about that.

02:45.750 --> 02:47.400
We just want the reputation,

02:47.750 --> 02:49.190
not to do evil things.

02:53.560 --> 02:56.030
Alright, I'll go scout ahead.

02:56.840 --> 02:58.590
Don't alert him to our presence.

02:58.590 --> 02:59.850
Be extremely careful.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.350
-Okay.
-Okay.

03:03.870 --> 03:06.070
Indeed, we can't harm innocent people.

03:06.310 --> 03:08.110
Right, we can't do such things.

03:10.630 --> 03:11.760
Young hero, save me!

03:13.680 --> 03:14.810
Save me, young hero!

03:14.840 --> 03:15.590
Put me down!

03:16.000 --> 03:16.730
Big Brother!

03:17.870 --> 03:18.600
Big Brother!

03:19.030 --> 03:19.560
Big Brother.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.120
Zuoqiu, Yuhan,

03:20.120 --> 03:21.310
what are you doing here?

03:21.310 --> 03:22.800
We're going to the Huanhua Sect
in Guangling.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.800
This is on the way.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.130
Big Brother,

03:26.560 --> 03:29.160
I couldn't get reinforcements
from my family.

03:29.430 --> 03:30.240
My father...

03:32.800 --> 03:34.400
If I hadn't fought back hard,

03:34.520 --> 03:37.079
he would have kept me
locked up at home too.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.360
I'm truly sorry.

03:42.079 --> 03:43.120
No worries.

03:44.470 --> 03:45.400
You're here now,

03:46.280 --> 03:48.120
standing by my side, aren't you?

03:48.750 --> 03:51.310
That's all I need from a brother.

03:53.440 --> 03:56.880
Big Brother, we heard about Feng Lang.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.450
Don't be too sad.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.060
We're all here for you.

04:01.170 --> 04:01.900
Big Brother,

04:02.870 --> 04:04.150
these are the Qu sisters,

04:04.150 --> 04:06.720
[Qu Sisters: Qu Minmiao, Qu Mushuang]

04:04.400 --> 04:05.750
Qu Mushuang and Qu Minmiao.

04:05.750 --> 04:06.680
Hello, Qiushui.

04:09.150 --> 04:11.080
The entire Qu family is ready to go.

04:11.680 --> 04:13.190
Everyone in the martial world
is talking about

04:13.190 --> 04:15.080
you bringing the Hero Command Token
to Guangling.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.279
They want to help too.

04:16.680 --> 04:18.279
That's why they came with us.

04:18.720 --> 04:20.560
They said after meeting up with you,

04:20.560 --> 04:22.390
we'll all return to Sword Manor together.

04:22.390 --> 04:24.920
That's good. With everyone united,

04:25.750 --> 04:27.040
our chances are better.

04:27.040 --> 04:27.630
Exactly.

04:28.070 --> 04:29.360
I hope Father is safe.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.240
Don't worry.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.480
The Xiao's Sword Manor is like a fortress.

04:33.480 --> 04:34.810
Enemies can't break in.

04:35.040 --> 04:35.950
We just need to

04:35.950 --> 04:38.409
hurry to the Xiao family villa
in Guangling.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.200
By the way,

04:40.800 --> 04:43.510
Tang Fang has been captured
by the Power Gang.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.750
Miss Tang?

04:44.750 --> 04:45.240
What?

04:46.159 --> 04:47.430
Up ahead is Guangling territory,

04:47.430 --> 04:49.310
where the Sword King's forces are based.

04:49.310 --> 04:50.510
Don't worry, Qiushui.

04:50.510 --> 04:51.240
There are many of us.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.770
We'll definitely find her.

04:53.120 --> 04:54.310
Guangling isn't big,

04:54.310 --> 04:55.750
but it's not small either.

04:55.750 --> 04:58.990
Finding someone is still quite difficult.

05:00.870 --> 05:03.190
The Sword King is the leader
of the Eight Kings of the Power Gang.

05:03.190 --> 05:05.680
He keeps a low profile
and will be difficult to fight.

05:05.680 --> 05:08.000
But have you heard of

05:08.000 --> 05:10.070
Qu Hanshan, He Who Shakes Guangling?

05:10.560 --> 05:13.000
Why don't we visit him
and ask for his help?

05:13.120 --> 05:14.070
Qu Hanshan?

05:14.510 --> 05:15.510
Father once said

05:15.830 --> 05:16.920
that in today's martial world,

05:16.920 --> 05:19.120
among the places with the most fairness

05:19.240 --> 05:21.000
are Mr. Qu's Top Fairness Forest

05:21.000 --> 05:23.000
and Mr. Liang Dou's
Self-Measuring Platform.

05:23.000 --> 05:25.000
Mr. Qu will surely not stand idly by.

05:26.750 --> 05:28.070
About inviting Mr. Qu,

05:28.870 --> 05:30.330
I'll go scout ahead first.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.360
If Mr. Qu is willing to help us,

05:34.830 --> 05:38.390
I believe our rescue mission
won't be so difficult.

05:38.870 --> 05:40.870
I think from here to Guangling Villa

05:40.950 --> 05:42.610
is about half a day's journey.

05:42.830 --> 05:44.960
Time is of the essence. Let's split up.

05:45.310 --> 05:47.159
And I need to trouble you all

05:47.560 --> 05:50.310
to take this news back to Guangling Villa

05:50.430 --> 05:52.030
and inform Yiren and Kaiyan.

05:52.120 --> 05:54.580
More people
will make things happen faster.

05:55.120 --> 05:58.040
I don't think Sword Manor
can wait any longer.

05:58.270 --> 05:59.680
Then we'll leave immediately.

05:59.680 --> 06:01.480
Big Brother, please be careful.

06:01.720 --> 06:02.250
Alright.

06:02.560 --> 06:03.890
Everyone, be cautious.

06:04.360 --> 06:04.890
Let's go.

06:15.540 --> 06:25.750
[Top Fairness Forest]

06:28.560 --> 06:30.560
What proof do you have that we did it?

06:48.550 --> 06:50.210
We need an explanation today.

06:51.430 --> 06:53.000
On what grounds
do you accuse us of murder?

06:53.000 --> 06:54.830
Mr. Qu, please be the judge here.

06:54.920 --> 06:55.720
Judge fairly.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.070
Let's be reasonable.

06:58.870 --> 07:00.930
Stop pointing fingers at each other.

07:01.360 --> 07:02.160
Based on what?

07:05.190 --> 07:07.270
Your Blood Blade Sect
was founded by butchers.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.360
You dare to allow your disciples

07:08.360 --> 07:09.600
to kill on my territory.

07:09.600 --> 07:11.270
How can Mr. Qu tolerate you?

07:11.560 --> 07:13.190
You're clearly just looking for trouble.

07:13.190 --> 07:14.270
Mr. Qu hasn't spoken yet.

07:14.270 --> 07:16.200
We won't tolerate your arrogance!

07:47.150 --> 07:49.860
[He Who Shakes Guangling, Qu Hanshan]

07:56.950 --> 08:00.350
Do you both know why this place
is called Top Fairness Forest?

08:02.000 --> 08:04.600
Because it's the fairest in the world.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.630
Anyone who comes here,

08:08.430 --> 08:10.480
whether skilled in martial arts or not,

08:10.480 --> 08:12.270
whether rich or poor,

08:12.680 --> 08:14.920
are all treated equally.

08:15.480 --> 08:18.240
I will never compromise fairness

08:18.560 --> 08:19.890
for anyone or anything.

08:25.240 --> 08:26.040
Master Qi,

08:26.830 --> 08:28.950
tour disciple committed murder
without cause.

08:28.950 --> 08:31.800
You should personally deliver
the murderer for punishment

08:31.800 --> 08:33.330
and face all consequences.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.799
Sect Leader Huo.

08:35.000 --> 08:35.440
Yes.

08:35.440 --> 08:36.600
After the culprit is punished,

08:36.600 --> 08:37.929
this matter should end.

08:37.960 --> 08:40.030
You must not allow your disciples
to continue provoking.

08:40.030 --> 08:41.480
Otherwise, both sides will fall into

08:41.480 --> 08:43.720
endless bloodshed and vengeance.

08:44.480 --> 08:47.480
If innocent civilians are harmed

08:47.480 --> 08:48.810
due to your sects' feud,

08:49.240 --> 08:52.700
I will certainly intervene
on behalf of the innocent victims.

08:52.910 --> 08:54.240
Do you both understand?

08:54.720 --> 08:57.180
We'll fully comply with
Mr. Qu's mediation.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.030
Good.

08:59.510 --> 09:01.550
All sects should focus on harmony

09:01.550 --> 09:03.080
and fight injustice together.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.410
The Northern Wasteland

09:04.630 --> 09:06.910
and the Power Gang
are both strong enemies.

09:06.910 --> 09:09.270
We should be united.

09:10.120 --> 09:13.240
Today, you two make this pledge here.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.620
If anyone breaks this pledge,

09:17.000 --> 09:19.060
he will face consequences like this.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.630
Mr. Qu truly deserves to be
the leader of the martial world.

09:36.630 --> 09:37.870
I will heed to Mr. Qu's teachings.

09:37.870 --> 09:41.730
-I will heed to Mr. Qu's teachings.
-I will heed to Mr. Qu's teachings.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.240
Mr. Qu.

10:13.550 --> 10:14.240
Mr. Qu,

10:14.670 --> 10:16.670
I'm from a side branch
of the Huanhua Sect.

10:16.670 --> 10:18.800
I need your help for something urgent.

10:19.790 --> 10:21.080
Of course.

10:22.160 --> 10:24.380
[Qu Residence]

10:31.120 --> 10:31.750
Master.

10:33.300 --> 10:35.760
I need to discuss important matters
with this young hero in my study.

10:35.760 --> 10:37.270
Make sure we're not disturbed.

10:37.270 --> 10:37.870
Yes.

10:38.270 --> 10:38.870
This way.

10:49.510 --> 10:50.960
Mr. Xiao, this way.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.390
Mr. Xiao.

11:00.150 --> 11:02.600
You said you're from a branch
of the Huanhua Sect

11:02.600 --> 11:04.750
and saw the Power Gang
besiege the sect,

11:04.750 --> 11:06.150
so you came seeking help.

11:12.390 --> 11:14.390
A friend who was traveling with me

11:15.630 --> 11:17.720
was captured by the Power Gang's
Burrow Demon

11:17.720 --> 11:19.200
and handed over to the Sword King.

11:19.200 --> 11:22.720
I humbly request
that you contact local heroes

11:23.550 --> 11:24.480
so we can quickly

11:25.950 --> 11:28.790
rescue my friend.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.320
How could I stand idly by?

11:34.120 --> 11:35.320
I just don't understand why
the Burrow Demon

11:35.320 --> 11:36.850
would capture your friend.

11:37.550 --> 11:38.480
As far as I know,

11:38.720 --> 11:41.180
the Power Gang
always has ulterior motives.

11:41.270 --> 11:42.510
They've gone so far as to

11:42.510 --> 11:45.960
put a bounty on Xiao Qiushui,
the third son of the Xiao family,

11:46.360 --> 11:49.690
all because he's rumored to possess
the Hero Command Token.

11:54.240 --> 11:55.440
Qiushui,

11:55.440 --> 11:56.840
why not be honest with me?

11:57.150 --> 11:59.270
Your father and I used to spar
by the river in the old days,

11:59.270 --> 12:01.150
enjoying many pleasant conversations.

12:01.150 --> 12:02.440
Looking at you,

12:02.510 --> 12:05.770
you have your father's features.
There's no mistaking it.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.960
I'm sorry to disappoint you, Mr. Qu.

12:09.270 --> 12:12.630
I shouldn't have kept things from you.

12:14.960 --> 12:16.600
You escaped from the Huanhua Sect

12:16.600 --> 12:18.390
and rushed all the way
to Guangling for help.

12:18.390 --> 12:21.270
You must have faced danger at every turn,
obstacles everywhere,

12:21.270 --> 12:22.630
to be so cautious now.

12:23.390 --> 12:26.720
Or perhaps it's because
you possess the Hero Command Token.

12:27.150 --> 12:29.000
You don't trust others or me.

12:29.510 --> 12:31.910
But that's understandable.

12:32.470 --> 12:34.960
Mr. Qu, that's not it.

12:38.550 --> 12:39.360
It's just...

12:41.440 --> 12:42.900
It's just that the Hero...

12:48.440 --> 12:49.600
Could he be...

12:58.840 --> 13:00.970
Actually, this Hero Command Token...

13:03.750 --> 13:04.550
I am

13:06.240 --> 13:07.390
truly ashamed.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.640
Old Madam Wu entrusted it to me,

13:10.750 --> 13:12.210
but I failed to protect it.

13:13.510 --> 13:14.370
What happened?

13:17.290 --> 13:18.530
I lost my companion,

13:20.270 --> 13:21.550
so I was distraught

13:22.200 --> 13:23.600
as I made my way to Guangling,

13:23.600 --> 13:26.130
where I ran into Song Mingzhu
from the Power Gang.

13:26.130 --> 13:27.370
She was ruthless.

13:28.270 --> 13:30.150
I barely escaped with my life.

13:31.100 --> 13:34.740
So, she stole the Hero Command Token.

13:44.120 --> 13:44.920
Mr. Qu.

13:45.510 --> 13:46.600
I've traveled far,

13:47.600 --> 13:50.260
seeking help from
all major martial arts sects.

13:50.480 --> 13:51.790
But none of them

13:52.000 --> 13:53.730
dared to offend the Power Gang.

13:53.840 --> 13:54.750
So, I...

13:57.120 --> 13:58.720
sincerely ask for your help.

14:00.630 --> 14:01.290
Youngster,

14:02.120 --> 14:04.840
the Hero Command Token
concerns the entire martial world.

14:04.840 --> 14:05.840
If it were to fall into the wrong hands,

14:05.840 --> 14:07.630
the consequences would be unimaginable.

14:07.630 --> 14:09.000
How could I not help?

14:09.600 --> 14:10.600
But Mr. Qu,

14:11.630 --> 14:12.960
this Hero Command Token

14:14.200 --> 14:15.930
has been hidden by Song Mingzhu

14:16.750 --> 14:18.280
and I don't know where it is.

14:18.510 --> 14:19.600
Don't worry.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.390
Since I've earned

14:21.390 --> 14:24.150
the title "He Who Shakes Guangling"
from my friends in the martial world,

14:24.150 --> 14:26.750
I will certainly find
the Sword King's whereabouts

14:26.750 --> 14:28.410
and help you find your friend.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.790
I won't let Song Mingzhu

14:30.790 --> 14:33.320
leave this place
with the Hero Command Token.

14:33.870 --> 14:35.390
I'll send people to search immediately.

14:35.390 --> 14:37.480
Just wait for my news at my residence.

14:45.310 --> 14:47.190
Tang Fang was captured by the Sword King,

14:47.190 --> 14:48.450
yet she appeared here.

14:49.910 --> 14:52.570
Since the Sword King
and Liu Suifeng are at odds,

14:53.320 --> 14:55.050
I can use one against the other.

15:27.710 --> 15:28.550
Song Mingzhu.

15:29.170 --> 15:32.040
You can't just come to Guangling
as you please.

15:32.840 --> 15:33.630
Be smart.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.980
Hand over the Hero Command Token.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.040
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

15:38.040 --> 15:39.840
Since you won't listen to reason,

15:39.840 --> 15:41.840
ask your master to come out.

15:47.770 --> 15:48.900
Long time no see.

15:50.440 --> 15:54.720
Sword King,
you're still so disrespectful to me.

15:56.270 --> 15:58.200
Deputy Chief Liu, you've come a long way

15:58.200 --> 15:59.730
to sneak into my territory.

16:00.000 --> 16:01.730
What brings you here this time?

16:01.990 --> 16:04.920
[Qu Hanshan]
[Power Gang's Sword King]

16:02.200 --> 16:05.400
The Chief ordered us to track down
the Hero Command Token.

16:05.480 --> 16:07.390
I tracked Xiao Qiushui to here.

16:07.720 --> 16:10.720
Isn't the Hero Command Token
already in your possession?

16:10.720 --> 16:12.650
Is that what Xiao Qiushui told you?

16:14.360 --> 16:17.550
I knew he would trick you
with such an excuse.

16:18.270 --> 16:20.910
At least now you've experienced

16:21.120 --> 16:22.670
how sly that fellow can be.

16:23.080 --> 16:26.280
Deputy Chief Liu,
you've always been quite calculating,

16:26.840 --> 16:29.240
yet you still haven't caught
that Xiao boy.

16:30.720 --> 16:33.120
Are you waiting for me
to clean up your mess?

16:34.150 --> 16:36.840
Sword King,
you should worry about yourself first.

16:36.840 --> 16:39.200
You've been a hero
for more than 20 years in Guangling.

16:39.200 --> 16:41.120
Now, your mask will be torn off.

16:41.600 --> 16:44.240
I feel sad for you, Sword King.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.930
The foundation I've built here

16:48.360 --> 16:49.240
won't be so easily shaken

16:49.240 --> 16:50.960
by that Xiao boy.

16:51.510 --> 16:52.720
Since he dared to come uninvited

16:52.720 --> 16:54.250
and step into my territory,

16:54.320 --> 16:56.980
he'd better be able to
handle the consequences.

16:58.150 --> 16:58.870
Goodbye.

16:59.870 --> 17:00.720
I didn't expect Qu Hanshan

17:00.720 --> 17:02.580
would find this place so quickly.

17:03.480 --> 17:06.200
Master, now that our whereabouts
have been exposed,

17:06.200 --> 17:07.480
what should we do next?

17:34.680 --> 17:36.880
So many people are guarding this place.

17:37.200 --> 17:39.260
There must be something suspicious.

18:02.870 --> 18:04.390
What a small world.

18:24.790 --> 18:26.250
Haven't seen you for days,

18:27.070 --> 18:28.880
and you've improved quite a bit.

18:48.860 --> 18:50.550
[Xiao Residence]

19:02.510 --> 19:04.830
Yiren, what did Father say?

19:07.590 --> 19:10.400
Father told us to stop investigating
the Marching Pill matter.

19:10.400 --> 19:12.750
He warned us not to act rashly again.

19:13.110 --> 19:14.000
Otherwise,

19:14.880 --> 19:16.550
Huanhua Sect will suffer endless troubles.

19:16.550 --> 19:17.830
Endless troubles?

19:19.590 --> 19:21.120
Did Father really say that?

19:22.550 --> 19:24.280
This is Father's handwriting.

19:27.590 --> 19:29.550
I'm not doubting what you said, Yiren.

19:29.550 --> 19:33.080
I just feel that Father always prioritizes
the bigger picture.

19:34.240 --> 19:37.680
It's strange that he would
say something like this.

19:45.350 --> 19:48.030
Perhaps Father has his own considerations.

19:48.880 --> 19:51.940
Father's view of the bigger picture
differs from ours.

19:52.510 --> 19:54.480
After all, protecting our family
and branch

19:54.480 --> 19:56.240
isn't just about loyalty.

19:56.510 --> 19:59.680
Sometimes, adapting to circumstances
and showing restraint

19:59.680 --> 20:01.080
isn't a sign of weakness.

20:02.920 --> 20:03.980
If that's the case,

20:04.680 --> 20:07.010
let's suspend the investigation for now.

20:14.520 --> 20:19.020
[Stop the Marching Pill investigation.
Don't act rashly, else Huanhua will
suffer endless troubles]

20:25.640 --> 20:28.440
Yiren, there's something wrong
with this letter.

20:29.110 --> 20:30.200
What's wrong with it?

20:30.200 --> 20:31.160
Look at the ink.

20:31.590 --> 20:32.510
Father usually

20:32.640 --> 20:35.030
favors pine soot ink made from
premium pine.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.360
But look at this letter.

20:36.510 --> 20:38.720
It's written with ordinary oil-soot ink.

20:38.720 --> 20:41.580
These two types of ink
smell completely different.

20:44.960 --> 20:47.680
You're saying this letter
wasn't written by Father

20:47.680 --> 20:48.660
but was forged by someone else?

20:48.660 --> 20:49.140
Yes.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.650
But this letter

20:51.070 --> 20:53.550
was definitely sent by a carrier pigeon
from the Xiao Residence.

20:53.550 --> 20:56.310
It would have passed through
all the Huanhua Sect checkpoints.

20:56.310 --> 20:57.770
If that's really the case,

20:58.550 --> 21:00.080
this is extremely serious.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.750
The Huanhua Sect must be in danger.

21:02.750 --> 21:03.550
Young Master!

21:04.680 --> 21:05.880
Something terrible has happened!

21:05.880 --> 21:07.920
Third Young Master's friends
are outside requesting to see you.

21:07.920 --> 21:08.480
They say

21:09.070 --> 21:12.070
the Sword Manor
has been surrounded by the Power Gang.

21:12.160 --> 21:12.750
What?

21:17.000 --> 21:20.520
How dare the Power Gang be so brazen!

21:21.030 --> 21:22.640
So all this time,

21:22.830 --> 21:24.160
the letters we received from Jindu

21:24.160 --> 21:25.200
were all tampered with.

21:25.200 --> 21:28.070
Yiren, the Power Gang has the audacity
to come to our doorstep.

21:28.070 --> 21:30.400
The Huanhua Sect isn't to be trifled with.

21:30.960 --> 21:31.790
Mr. Xiao said

21:32.110 --> 21:34.030
the Sword Manor can hold out
for a few more days,

21:34.030 --> 21:36.030
but we were repeatedly ambushed
on our way here.

21:36.030 --> 21:37.830
We've already lost a lot of time,

21:37.960 --> 21:40.480
and I fear the journey back
won't be any easier.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.540
Yiren, we need to make plans quickly.

21:43.510 --> 21:44.110
Qin.

21:44.200 --> 21:44.590
Yes.

21:45.880 --> 21:48.070
Gather all our people from Guangling
and Huanhua immediately.

21:48.070 --> 21:49.480
Prepare to leave with me at once

21:49.480 --> 21:50.480
to return and aid Sword Manor.

21:50.480 --> 21:51.010
Yes, sir.

21:52.720 --> 21:53.580
Kaiyan, Xueyu,

21:53.640 --> 21:54.830
you two will stay behind.

21:54.830 --> 21:56.590
Yiren, why is that?

21:57.070 --> 21:59.530
The situation in Jinzhong remains unclear.

21:59.720 --> 22:01.400
It's too dangerous for you to come along.

22:01.400 --> 22:04.260
Better to stay here as backup
and seek outside help.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.110
Your plan is thorough,

22:06.350 --> 22:09.000
but you're actually the one
who should stay behind.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.590
You are Huanhua Sect's acting leader.

22:10.590 --> 22:13.030
You have reputation and prestige
in the martial world.

22:13.030 --> 22:15.880
If you personally sought help
from the Guangling sects,

22:15.880 --> 22:18.010
things would likely go much smoother.

22:18.350 --> 22:19.480
Well said.

22:23.730 --> 22:24.880
-Miss Weng.
-Miss Weng.

22:24.880 --> 22:27.010
[Weng Yueying of Bishan Sect]

22:26.510 --> 22:29.000
Miss Weng has learned about
the Huanhua Sect

22:29.400 --> 22:30.460
being surrounded?

22:31.640 --> 22:34.070
I understand your eagerness
to return and help.

22:34.070 --> 22:36.680
But in difficult times,
we must remain steady.

22:37.880 --> 22:38.680
Rest assured.

22:38.880 --> 22:42.400
My Sect Leader has already sent letters
to the Shaolin and Wudang Sects,

22:42.400 --> 22:44.400
asking them to assist Huanhua Sect.

22:47.350 --> 22:49.010
The Bishan Sect is honorable.

22:49.550 --> 22:51.200
But the Shaolin and Wudang Sects
are far away.

22:51.200 --> 22:54.030
I fear distant help won't solve
our immediate crisis.

22:54.030 --> 22:56.400
Right now, you are
the backbone of Huanhua Sect.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.400
You must stay

22:57.640 --> 23:00.400
and personally gather allies in Guangling.

23:00.720 --> 23:04.250
Only then will Sword Manor
and Huanhua Sect have a chance to win.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.300
Miss Weng is right.

23:07.750 --> 23:09.680
Then I'll have Mr. Kong

23:10.070 --> 23:11.670
lead the Dragon-Tiger Squad

23:11.680 --> 23:12.720
to Sword Manor.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.200
After we get reinforcements,

23:15.270 --> 23:16.200
we'll join them.

23:16.640 --> 23:18.790
Big Brother is visiting Mr. Qu
to ask for help.

23:18.790 --> 23:19.680
If he succeeds,

23:20.000 --> 23:21.030
after rescuing Tang Fang,

23:21.030 --> 23:22.640
Big Brother will surely ask him

23:22.640 --> 23:24.240
to help Huanhua Sword Manor.

23:25.030 --> 23:28.270
Mr. Qu is indeed the leader
of the Guangling martial world.

23:28.270 --> 23:29.590
If we can get Mr. Qu

23:29.880 --> 23:31.440
to gather Guangling's heroes

23:31.440 --> 23:33.270
to stand up for justice
in the martial world,

23:33.270 --> 23:35.470
then Huanhua Sect will surely be saved.

23:38.720 --> 23:39.400
Yiren.

23:40.680 --> 23:42.030
Qiushui acts too rashly.

23:42.030 --> 23:43.790
I'm worried about him going alone.

23:43.790 --> 23:46.480
I'll go personally
to invite Mr. Qu right away.

23:46.640 --> 23:48.790
Yiren, I'll go with you.

23:52.850 --> 23:55.330
[Qu Residence]

24:06.550 --> 24:08.790
Qiushui, you've given me quite a trip

24:09.110 --> 24:11.350
and quite a grand welcome gift indeed.

24:12.750 --> 24:14.070
Don't act so friendly.

24:14.640 --> 24:17.070
Even this place,
known as the fairest in the world,

24:17.070 --> 24:19.000
has surrendered to the Power Gang.

24:19.510 --> 24:21.400
The so-called "He Who Shakes Guangling"

24:21.400 --> 24:22.920
is nothing but a joke.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.980
Wherever I am is where justice prevails.

24:24.980 --> 24:27.710
I will make sure
everyone knows your true nature.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.960
That's if you can escape alive

24:30.960 --> 24:32.430
from the Sword King.

24:36.830 --> 24:37.830
The time has come.

24:38.000 --> 24:39.680
Even if everyone knows,

24:39.960 --> 24:41.400
what can they do to me?

24:43.920 --> 24:45.480
I am still a fair man

24:45.880 --> 24:48.400
and don't want to make things difficult
for you youngsters.

24:48.400 --> 24:50.330
As long as you hand over what I want,

24:50.590 --> 24:52.120
you can take anyone with you

24:52.310 --> 24:54.240
and leave my residence safely.

25:03.110 --> 25:05.030
You want the Hero Command Token.

25:06.440 --> 25:08.100
I never thought the Sword King

25:08.310 --> 25:11.750
would also believe such baseless rumors
from the martial world.

25:11.750 --> 25:13.010
The Hero Command Token

25:13.480 --> 25:15.240
couldn't possibly be with me.

25:16.680 --> 25:18.010
If you don't believe me,

25:18.400 --> 25:19.600
then come and search.

25:20.790 --> 25:21.310
Master.

25:24.640 --> 25:25.700
There's a visitor.

25:25.720 --> 25:26.650
Tell him to wait.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.880
It's an old acquaintance of yours.

25:27.080 --> 25:28.960
[Liu Qianbian]
[Power Gang's Traceless Demon]

25:28.020 --> 25:30.480
He came in before the doorman
could stop him.

25:30.480 --> 25:32.550
Mr. Qu, you're practicing calligraphy?

25:32.550 --> 25:34.200
Have I come at a bad time?

25:36.160 --> 25:36.640
Go.

25:47.030 --> 25:48.830
I want you to watch carefully

25:49.510 --> 25:53.480
how these so-called heroes
walk right into the trap.

26:07.310 --> 26:07.960
Mr. Qu.

26:07.780 --> 26:09.770
[Free-Spirited Sage, Gu Junshan]

26:08.440 --> 26:10.240
I didn't expect you to come to Guangling.

26:10.240 --> 26:11.510
I apologize for not greeting you properly.

26:11.510 --> 26:12.310
Please, sit.

26:12.880 --> 26:15.270
There's something urgent
and I couldn't notify you in advance.

26:15.270 --> 26:16.590
I've come unannounced.

26:16.590 --> 26:18.190
Please forgive my rudeness.

26:23.110 --> 26:23.830
Mr. Gu.

26:26.510 --> 26:28.750
Is Mr. Kang also a guest here?

26:29.270 --> 26:31.110
Mr. Kang just arrived two days ago.

26:31.110 --> 26:33.840
We're all friends here.
No need for formalities.

26:34.720 --> 26:35.850
Please, have a seat.

26:36.960 --> 26:37.750
Very well.

26:39.030 --> 26:40.790
Mr. Qu, do you know about

26:41.400 --> 26:43.930
the Wu Army's sudden appearance
in Jinzhong?

26:48.160 --> 26:48.920
Really?

26:49.400 --> 26:50.240
Is that so?

26:50.720 --> 26:51.580
We learned that

26:51.640 --> 26:53.680
the Wu Army rescued Old Madam Wu

26:53.880 --> 26:55.510
from the Power Gang's ambush.

26:55.510 --> 26:56.880
We rushed there immediately

26:56.880 --> 26:59.400
and followed
the Power Gang's escape trail,

26:59.830 --> 27:02.880
unexpectedly leading us
all the way to Guangling.

27:03.880 --> 27:07.350
Are you saying Power Gang members
are hiding in Guangling?

27:15.480 --> 27:18.270
That's right. I've been tracking
the Power Gang for a long time.

27:18.270 --> 27:19.680
I previously discovered

27:19.880 --> 27:23.240
the Sword King is likely
within Guangling territory.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.790
Now that our investigation
has led us here,

27:25.790 --> 27:27.050
we must be on our guard.

27:36.640 --> 27:39.170
Indeed, we need to be
extremely careful then.

27:40.960 --> 27:42.220
I heard from the Wu Army

27:42.350 --> 27:44.200
that those who escorted Old Madam Wu

27:44.200 --> 27:45.930
were the Xiaos of Huanhua Sect.

27:50.560 --> 27:52.510
Mr. Kang, if I remember correctly,

27:53.070 --> 27:55.130
you and Xilou are old friends, right?

27:55.680 --> 27:56.610
Then these days,

27:57.200 --> 28:00.790
shouldn't you be celebrating
the Dragon Boat Festival in Huanhua?

28:00.790 --> 28:03.110
How come you're in Guangling?

28:04.070 --> 28:05.000
Unfortunately,

28:05.510 --> 28:07.070
I had some matters to attend to this year

28:07.070 --> 28:09.350
and couldn't
keep my appointment with Xilou.

28:09.350 --> 28:11.720
If I had known earlier
that Huanhua Sect would be so righteous

28:11.720 --> 28:13.120
in rescuing Old Madam Wu,

28:13.550 --> 28:16.350
I should have done my part to help.

28:24.810 --> 28:26.210
Who's behind the screen?

28:28.400 --> 28:30.590
Just a young guest staying here.

28:30.720 --> 28:33.320
He has severe sores
and doesn't want to be seen.

28:40.330 --> 28:43.460
Didn't you just say
the Sword King might be in Guangling?

28:44.310 --> 28:44.750
Yes.

28:45.110 --> 28:47.270
I was investigating the massacre

28:47.270 --> 28:48.920
of a prominent family in Guangling.

28:48.920 --> 28:52.270
I found sword marks
that might've belonged to the Sword King.

28:52.270 --> 28:55.070
How can you identify the Sword King
just from sword marks?

28:55.070 --> 28:57.730
Not just that.
I also found a strand of gray hair.

29:00.880 --> 29:01.880
The killer might

29:01.880 --> 29:03.880
also be an elderly swordsman.

29:05.590 --> 29:06.550
Everyone knows

29:06.880 --> 29:09.310
the Sword King
has a unique protective energy.

29:09.310 --> 29:11.170
He only uses it in extreme danger.

29:11.240 --> 29:13.790
When that happens,
his internal energy surges,

29:13.790 --> 29:15.270
causing his hair to turn gray.

29:15.270 --> 29:17.790
This is completely different
from ordinary elders.

29:17.790 --> 29:18.720
And coincidentally,

29:18.720 --> 29:21.640
we found something else nearby.

29:32.470 --> 29:33.680
Mr. Kang, take a look.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.960
Did you lose this?

29:37.510 --> 29:40.000
This can't be a coincidence too, can it?

29:51.000 --> 29:52.730
You've misunderstood, Mr. Gu.

29:53.640 --> 29:55.270
My jade disc

29:55.640 --> 29:57.160
has been with me all along.

30:15.680 --> 30:16.810
Be careful, Senior!

30:20.070 --> 30:20.640
Senior!

30:21.070 --> 30:22.670
Qu Hanshan is the Sword King!

30:23.510 --> 30:24.770
You are the Sword King?

30:25.240 --> 30:28.200
Mr. Gu, we've been friends for 20 years

30:28.480 --> 30:30.160
and stood together
as Guangling's Three Peaks.

30:30.160 --> 30:31.560
I didn't want to harm you,

30:32.030 --> 30:34.230
but you came at the worst possible time.

31:07.550 --> 31:10.160
What's that smell? Why is it so foul?

31:12.350 --> 31:14.480
Kang Chuyu, you've been poisoned.

31:14.750 --> 31:17.350
If not treated within an hour, you'll die.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.370
Tang Fang.

32:12.200 --> 32:14.860
Go! Mr. Gu Junshan
is holding off the Sword King.

32:15.160 --> 32:15.960
Xiao Qiushui.

32:16.920 --> 32:18.120
You're Xiao Qiushui?

32:19.830 --> 32:20.720
You're not Xiao Donghuo?

32:20.720 --> 32:21.880
You've been lying to us!

32:21.880 --> 32:23.420
Let's not talk about this now.

32:23.420 --> 32:23.980
Hurry!

32:24.240 --> 32:24.950
Let's go, let's go.

32:24.950 --> 32:25.500
Go where?

32:26.270 --> 32:28.070
Let's deal with these two first.

32:28.150 --> 32:30.260
Miss, this was my idea.

32:30.750 --> 32:32.350
Please don't hurt my friend!

32:32.430 --> 32:33.350
You... Kill me instead!

32:33.350 --> 32:34.070
-Kill me!
-Shut up!

32:34.070 --> 32:35.830
He kidnapped you because of me.

32:35.830 --> 32:37.510
If you want to kill someone,
kill me. Let him go.

32:37.510 --> 32:38.240
Kill me!

32:38.240 --> 32:40.100
-Kill me! Kill me!
-Stop arguing.

32:40.760 --> 32:43.090
Tang Fang, they don't deserve to die.

32:43.720 --> 32:45.790
The situation is extremely urgent now.

32:45.790 --> 32:46.960
Let's get out of here first, then talk.

32:46.960 --> 32:47.510
Go!

32:49.510 --> 32:50.400
Go.

32:58.940 --> 33:01.420
Mr. Gu, why are you doing this?

33:27.510 --> 33:29.440
The Free-Spirited Sage Gu Junshan

33:29.480 --> 33:31.680
is quite renowned in the martial world.

33:32.270 --> 33:36.070
It's a pity
you'll meet your end here today.

33:37.400 --> 33:40.670
Qu Hanshan, I misjudged you.

33:41.400 --> 33:42.280
Why?

33:42.640 --> 33:43.510
Why?

33:45.070 --> 33:47.640
In life, people only seek three things:

33:47.640 --> 33:50.480
money, status, and followers.

33:50.750 --> 33:52.640
Together, they equal power.

33:53.510 --> 33:55.110
And the Power Gang has it all.

33:56.590 --> 34:00.850
I can't believe I was ranked alongside you
as one of Guangling's Three Peaks.

34:05.830 --> 34:07.640
Why so pessimistic, Gu?

34:08.230 --> 34:10.320
The Power Gang needs talented people.

34:10.320 --> 34:13.110
Haven't you always hated
the chaos in the martial world?

34:13.110 --> 34:15.770
Only the Power Gang
can unite the martial world.

34:15.840 --> 34:18.000
Chief Li Chenzhou
values ability above all.

34:18.000 --> 34:19.400
If you join the Power Gang,

34:19.400 --> 34:22.530
we can still stand together
and look down upon the world.

34:23.360 --> 34:25.480
Even if it means doing evil things?

34:25.710 --> 34:27.440
Do you still think the Power Gang

34:27.440 --> 34:29.770
is just a ragtag group shouting for blood?

34:30.440 --> 34:32.170
I'm telling you, you're wrong!

34:33.190 --> 34:34.920
The Chief has great ambitions.

34:35.510 --> 34:38.800
Perhaps it's something
even the Emperor cannot accomplish.

34:38.800 --> 34:39.760
If you join us—

34:39.760 --> 34:42.090
I, Gu, am ashamed
to have been your friend.

34:43.340 --> 34:46.199
You want me to sink to your level,
you old scoundrel?

34:46.480 --> 34:47.590
Never!

34:48.320 --> 34:52.760
Mr. Gu, your vision is far too narrow.

35:03.070 --> 35:04.730
The Sword King needs no sword.

35:05.510 --> 35:07.550
He can turn anything into a sword.

35:08.030 --> 35:11.000
Even with empty hands,
he can summon sword energy.

35:11.550 --> 35:15.030
I never thought that before my death,

35:15.030 --> 35:17.090
I would still learn a lesson from you.

35:20.920 --> 35:23.120
I just want to ask you one last question.

35:24.030 --> 35:26.690
Du Yueshan, who once
shared the title with us...

35:28.070 --> 35:29.480
Where is he now?

35:46.720 --> 35:47.400
Senior.

35:48.510 --> 35:49.760
Why did you come back?

35:50.360 --> 35:51.560
Don't worry, Senior.

35:52.630 --> 35:53.280
I will

35:54.880 --> 35:56.150
protect your safety.

35:59.550 --> 36:00.230
Alright.

36:04.070 --> 36:04.870
Xiao Qiushui,

36:05.320 --> 36:08.960
hand over the Hero Command Token
and join forces with the Power Gang.

36:08.960 --> 36:11.160
You'll have a bright future ahead of you

36:11.280 --> 36:13.210
and achieve great success one day.

36:23.860 --> 36:25.720
As the Sword Master of Guangling,

36:26.190 --> 36:29.320
you disregarded morality
for the sake of your own future

36:29.630 --> 36:31.630
and became the Power Gang's lackey.

36:32.230 --> 36:34.230
Even if I had the Hero Command Token,

36:35.320 --> 36:36.850
I would never give it to you.

36:37.880 --> 36:39.010
If you are stubborn,

36:39.880 --> 36:41.550
you can only die.

37:16.400 --> 37:18.000
Senior!

37:25.360 --> 37:27.230
No!

37:41.480 --> 37:42.550
Run!

37:43.550 --> 37:44.880
You must escape

37:45.190 --> 37:47.320
-and expose this demon's secret!
-Go!

37:47.320 --> 37:48.110
Senior!

37:48.840 --> 37:49.710
Go!

37:50.360 --> 37:51.220
-Let’s go.
-Go!

37:51.710 --> 37:53.400
Xiao Qiushui, don't even think about it!

37:53.400 --> 37:54.630
Let me go!

37:57.710 --> 37:59.590
Senior!

38:00.320 --> 38:01.550
Go!

38:07.710 --> 38:08.550
Go!

38:09.440 --> 38:10.440
Xiao Qiushui!

38:39.670 --> 38:40.870
Someone's over here!

38:43.480 --> 38:44.340
It's a dead end!

38:48.110 --> 38:48.920
Xiao Qiushui.

38:52.210 --> 38:53.330
You dare trick me?

39:30.920 --> 39:31.880
Go ahead.

39:32.750 --> 39:34.480
Let's see where you can run now.

39:35.370 --> 39:37.900
Young hero, we're trapped.
What should we do?

39:42.590 --> 39:43.920
We'll fight our way out.

39:45.190 --> 39:47.050
Even if only one of us makes it out,

39:47.710 --> 39:48.880
we must expose Qu Hanshan

39:48.880 --> 39:50.610
for the cunning fox he truly is.

39:51.440 --> 39:51.970
Alright.

39:52.800 --> 39:54.280
Those who block me will die!

39:54.280 --> 39:55.480
Those who hurt me will perish!

39:55.480 --> 39:56.110
Come on!

40:07.920 --> 40:08.670
Fools.

40:13.510 --> 40:15.240
-Qiu! Qiu!
-What are you doing?

40:15.440 --> 40:16.230
Qiu, are you okay?

40:16.230 --> 40:16.920
You're crushing me!

40:16.920 --> 40:17.550
Qiu!

40:19.510 --> 40:20.150
Qiu!

40:21.430 --> 40:23.000
How are you? Are you alright?

40:23.000 --> 40:23.530
I'm fine.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.030
Did you bite my face?

40:25.030 --> 40:26.110
It was an accident.

40:28.400 --> 40:29.440
Where are we?

40:38.500 --> 40:41.500
Listen. There's the sound
of running water.

40:42.630 --> 40:43.630
If there's water,

40:44.190 --> 40:46.670
then there must be an exit.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.370
How about this?

40:48.760 --> 40:50.000
Everyone look around.

40:50.000 --> 40:50.710
Okay.

40:51.800 --> 40:53.130
Let's go that way first.

40:55.430 --> 40:57.430
Qiu, it's fine. Don't worry.

41:06.070 --> 41:08.360
This cave is way too long.

41:12.510 --> 41:13.230
It's okay.

41:19.710 --> 41:21.030
What is this place?

41:33.180 --> 41:35.430
Master, the cave also has...

41:35.960 --> 41:37.020
It doesn't matter.

41:37.190 --> 41:40.050
They chose to walk
into this death trap themselves.

41:41.200 --> 41:43.110
Heaven is truly on my side.

41:57.070 --> 41:58.330
Are you human or ghost?

41:58.960 --> 42:00.480
Why do you look so familiar?

42:00.480 --> 42:01.550
-Yeah.
-Let’s go.

42:01.840 --> 42:03.040
-Let’s go.
-Don’t go.

42:18.550 --> 42:20.150
Is this person dead or alive?

42:23.470 --> 42:23.990
Slow down.
